{
  "version": 1,
  "since": "2026-09-03",
  "about": "Twenty golden tasks, weighted by what people actually ask agents for (docs/research/2026-09-03-what-people-ask-agents-for.md): revise first, then create, then restyle and repair. A task is a synthetic starting screen, an ask in plain words, and checks a machine can make. `screen` checks are scripts/grade.mjs's; the rest read the file. Every answer here passes; every untouched fixture fails at least one — scripts/golden.mjs --selftest proves both. Change a task and bump the version.",
